@host = http://localhost:5080

### A valid product: 201 Created
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Coffee", "price": 4.5 }

### Every invalid field at once: 400, with "details" per field
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "price": -1 }

### The same name again: 409, code "product.name_taken"
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "coffee", "price": 5 }

### An unknown id: 404, code "product.not_found"
GET {{host}}/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
